     8332               run lib-rwds_crtrnsum in this-procedure ( input bf_trn-doc.doc-code
     8333                                                       , input 'wstc':U ) no-error.
     8334               if error-status :error then do:
     8335                 run waitfram-hide in p-rwdshandle no-error.
     8336                 undo, return error substitute(
