     8354                                                         , input bf_doc-line.prod-type
     8355                                                         , input bf_doc-line.prod-code ) no-error.
     8356                 if error-status :error then do:
     8357                   run waitfram-hide in p-rwdshandle no-error.
     8358                   undo, return error return-value.
     8359                 end.
     8360               end.
     8361             end.
     8362             else do:
     8363               run waitfram-show in p-rwdshandle ( input substitute( 'Очищаем запись для сумм типа "&1". Время &2.'
     8364                                                                   , 'wstc':U
     8365                                                                   , string( time - j#time, "hh:mm:ss":U ) ) ) no-error.
     8366               run lib-rwds_cltrnsum in this-procedure ( input bf_trn-doc.doc-code
     8367                                                       , input 'wstc':U ) no-error.
     8368               if error-status :error then do:
     8369                 run waitfram-hide in p-rwdshandle no-error.
     8370                 undo, return error substitute(
